// Role name: Tenant Access
// Create one role. Paste the expression onto every table listed below.
// The expression is the same. [org_id] means the org_id column of the table
// you are pasting onto. Do not paste this onto security_mapping, dim_date,
// dim_job_level, dim_employment_type, dim_leave_type, or leave_entitlement.
//
// Why it is repeated: a star schema does not filter one dimension from another.
// A filter only on dim_organisation secures the facts, and leaves the employee
// name list and the department slicer able to show other tenants.

// dim_organisation
// fact_employee_monthly
// fact_leave
// fact_performance
// dim_department
// dim_employee
// salary_data_errors
[org_id] =
LOOKUPVALUE (
    security_mapping[org_id],
    security_mapping[user_email],
    USERPRINCIPALNAME ()
)
